Title: 'Young persons knowing some students'.
Author: 'Dr. Sabin Buraga'.
Namespace: 'http://www.info.uaic.ro/wade/young-persons'.

Comment: 'TBox'.
Every young-person has-age lower-than 40.
Every young-person is a person.
Every person is a living-thing.
Every male is a person.
Every female is a person.
No male is a female.
Every student is a person.
X knows Y if-and-only-if Y known-by X.
Every young-person knows a student.

Comment: 'ABox'.
Ana is a female.
Ana is a young-person that knows Dan.
Cristina known-by Ana.
Dan is a male.
Cristina is a young-person that knows Dan.
George knows a student.
